  "CardHelpSection": {
    "ParentObjectID": "advanced_copper_tools_lantern_oilwell",
    "LocalizationKey": "Advanced_Copper_Tools_LanternOilwell_CardHelpSection",
    "DefaultText": "<b>Crafted:</b> Hammered from a metal sheet with 1 twine and 1 tin solder.\n\n<b>Fuel:</b> Pour in lamp oil (each clay bowl adds 48; two bowls fill it), then light it from any fire source. A full fill burns 24 hours and gives a small light. Extinguish it to refuel.\n\n<b>Uses:</b> Also the fount of a Metal Lantern, which burns twice as long."
  },
